  "bodyHash": "72c7971f90f9eef4",
  "content": "你好世界Here is the translation of the provided text into Traditional Chinese (zh-TW). The formatting, including images and special styled elements, has been preserved as requested:\n\n<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/book.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span><p style=\"line-height: 1.38;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">Extra Delight 是一款積極擴展「農民的美食」中耕作與烹飪玩法的模組。</span></p> <span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/oven.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span> \n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">烤箱 - 一個 3x3 的製台。只要有下方有熱源，且托盤槽內有適當的烘焙用具，它就會慢慢烘焙配方。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">麵團塑形機 - 用於麵團的石質切割器！可用各種麵團製作麵條或餅乾。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">攪拌碗 - 混合所有美味的食物！放入相應的物品（甚至液體），然後用正確的餐具右鍵點擊它。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">研缽 - 用於壓碎食材以獲取內部的精華！這是製作無需稻草麵包的第一步。需要配合它忠誠的夥伴——研杵使用。也可以製作出煮食油等流體。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">晾乾架 - 需要讓它變乾！可以製作出肉乾或水果乾，或是將食材晾乾以便研磨成粉。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">熔鍋 - 將固體熔化成液體。需要下方有熱源。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">冷藏機 - 將液體凍結成固體。可製作出各種（主要是巧克力味）的美食。需要某種容器讓液體凝固，並偶爾清空滴漏盤。</span>\n\n<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/spoon.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">湯匙 - 你轉得我眼冒金星。在攪拌碗中混合食材、舀取美味的食物，甚至在 FD 切菜板上刨薑！！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">研杵 - 磨粉不停歇，你也別停下！可以用於碾壓小麥種子、烘焙咖啡豆、乾燥海帶片，甚至是花朵以提取更多染料（當然是在研缽中使用）。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">烘焙用具/托盤 - 可用於烤箱（偶爾也可用於冷藏機）。包括烤盤、鬆餅模具、派盤等等！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">磨絲器 - 完全磨成絲狀。在 FD 切菜板上磨乳酪、馬鈴薯、胡蘿蔔等。</span> \n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">抹刀 - 你的廚房仙女棒！揮舞這一魔法棒，你的廚房就焕然一新了。可用於霜凍薑餅和巧克力方塊改變花紋，也能為你的研缽、攪拌碗和烘焙用具換上新造型。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">漏斗 - 流體的鐵錠！可以**從**混合碗**中**流出，**從**研缽**中**流出，以及**進出**酒桶、罐子或冷藏機。你也可以用桶子或罐子 manually 從頂部倒入流體。如果它上方剛好有流體方塊，它還會自動吸出來從底部排出。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">罐子 - 用於收集少於（或等於一桶）的流體。例如，可以從研缽舀取流體並轉移到攪拌碗，或者直接放在架上。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">酒桶 - 可儲存最多 8 桶同一種流體，是漏斗的最佳搭檔。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none\">水龍頭（原始形態） - 用桶子右鍵點擊即可裝滿水，滴滴答答。</span> \n\n<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/crops.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">所有 Extra Delight 作物都使用生態群系標籤，因此可以在所有修改過的生態群落及原版生態群落中找到。蜜蜂可以為它們授粉，部分作物也可用來餵養動物。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">肉桂 - 生長在叢林生態群落中的樹木，樹皮美味可口。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">生薑 - 一種辛辣的根莖植物，熱帶生態群落中開有漂亮的紅花。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">薄荷 - 薄荷必須蔓延開來！出現在寒冷生態群落中，但在溫暖或溫帶生態群落中會更快樂。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">玉米 - 高大的草莖，常見於較乾燥的草原生態群落。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">棉花 - 大片白色花朵，生長在沼澤生態群落中。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">辣椒 - 超級辣！當然生長在熱帶生態群落中。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">花生 - 這是豌豆還是堅果？不管它是什麼，你會在叢林生態群落中找到它那小小的黃色花朵。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">榛子 - 對榛子癡迷不已！是的，你可以把它製成某種巧克力醬……請在森林生態群落中尋找它。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">咖啡 - 咖啡因攝入過多嗎？那就去叢林生態群落尋找這種開著紅黃櫻桃的小灌木，滿足你的渴望吧。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">蘋果 - 是的，現在你再也不必為了看醫生而砍伐鄰區的樹了！這很貼切，因為它會生長在森林生態群落中。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">大蒜 - 洋蔥的小弟加入家族！可在溫帶山坡上找到它。</span> \n\n<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/ketchup.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">生活中需要一些醋嗎？一些麵包屑？可能是糖霜或餅乾麵團？像蛋黄醬或番茄醬的調味品？玉米麵？黃油？肉汁？打發奶油！？</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">可以說，Extra Delight 中有大量可操作的食材（超過一百種！），還有更多可以製作的食材！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">並且我們還提供 31 種選項，讓每個液體都以桶的形式出現，有些你可能 miiiight 不願意踏入其中……<br></span> \n\n__<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/custard.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>__\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">115 種鹹鮮餐點</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">油炸食品、沙拉、意麪、漢堡、早餐穀物。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">92 種甜美甜點</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">卡士達、冰淇淋、烘焙食品、冰棒！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">64 種糖果</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">所有你想要的巧克力、薄荷、焦糖。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">23 種飲品解渴</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">果汁、奶昔、三種方式的熱可可，甚至蛋釀酒。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">22 種餅乾獻給各位怪物們</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">節慶形狀餅乾海量供應。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">17 種零食，當你必須 munch on <span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: italic; text-decoration: none;\">something</span> 時享用。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">薯片、 popcorn、肉乾</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: nore;\">如果你有 Butchercraft，還有另外 28 種肉食愛好者們的 delights。</span> \n\n__<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/jelly.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>__\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">如果有 Butchercraft，強大的 78 種盛宴可擺上你的 banquet table。它們看起來都很漂亮，而且大部分吃完後會留下內疚的痕跡……</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">大快朵頤豐盛的千層麵，給自己盛些辣椒，切七種芝士蛋糕中的一種，將任何東西蘸入巧克力 fondue，甚至沉入一整座 <span style=\"color: #f00;\">r</span><span style=\"color: #f90;\">a</span><span style=\"color: #ff0;\">i</span><span style=\"color: #0f0;\">n</span><span style=\"color: #0ff;\">b</span><span style=\"color: #00f;\">o</span><span style=\"color: #90f;\">w</span> 的果冻中。</span> \n\n__<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/cabinet.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>__\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">兩種新的木材組合！肉桂木比 Acacia 更亮橙色；水果木是 Jungle 更明亮淡化的同胞，甚至也有水平樹皮花紋。</span>\n\n![](https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXecGYV2nEQasTsH1-TMmXltH9qHd-t_V5tA1weYx225dsGoP145ellNGp-Gr-hYf4iGIu6U0aEKoiC6XxNAGh_Q3Zl1Qu5stw8uXMrypPnuvgPlOKXBOKbACkjV7BvWcky__OHYRA?key=qrDTHmrylnAmnfWStjqRVQ)\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">所有木制物品都可以在所有原版和 Extra Delight 的木材類型中製成。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">木制傢俱</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">壁紙 - 提供全部 16 種顏色，並可以搭配木質裝飾條，然後放置在方塊的頂部或底部。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">香料架 - 可愛的小架子，擁有 4 個物品欄位。可以作為“填充”variant 製成展示裝飾性罐子，或作為“未填充” variant 儲存物品。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">半櫃 - 像 FD 櫃一樣，但只有一半深度！非常適合用作吊櫃，可以偷偷地存儲和同尺寸姊妹一樣多的物品……</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">刀架 - 視覺上可儲存 4 把刀（包括 Butchercraft 的刀）。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">階梯凳 - 方便的踏步。就像板塊一樣，你會自動踏上去。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">檯面櫃 - 看起來就和它們常規的 FD 表親一樣……直到你點擊齒輪並給它任何具有實心圖紋（不包括葉子）的方塊作為檯面圖紋，然後它會神奇地長出一個小檯面邊緣。適用冰、玻璃、板塊、ED 酒桶、FD 爐灶……可能性是無窮的！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">水槽 - 帶有水槽的櫥櫃！滿足你所有的水需求。雖然它的存儲容量減小以容納水管……但它也有設置檯面圖紋的選擇，以便完美融入你的操作臺。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">風乾玉米籬笆 - 普通的籬笆覺得不够鄉村風？試試風乾玉米版本，增加一點視覺趣味。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: non-e;\">非木制物品</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">花環 - 好吧它們跟木材有關？用任何葉子類型做一個節日花環，然後在上面擺放 8 樣…任何東西。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">蝴蝶結 - 花環的最佳好友！提供全部 16 種羊毛顏色，可戴在頭上、掛在花環上或製成漂亮的盒子……</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">巧克力盒 - 它們就是盒子。你把巧克力（或糖果）放進去，然後蓋上蓋子，拿起來給特別的人。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">糖果碗 - 用途非常相似，但只有單色，而且拿著內容物時無法拾起。看起來在你的檯面上很漂亮！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">食物展示架 - 如果你想展示某物而不讓它在碗中搞混，那就看這裡吧！想開設超市？甚至可以用玻璃塊右鍵點擊添加玻璃前門。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">三套（也許四套）巧克力建築方塊。它們不是完整的“套”，但有方塊、階梯、板、門、陷阱門、柱子、籬笆和籬笆門。去建造你的城堡吧。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">奶酪和黃油方塊！方塊、板、階梯。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">儲存方塊 - 箱子袋子和麻袋存儲所有 Extra Delight 的作物（以及 FD 遺漏的一些原版物品，如漿果和蘑菇），還有如肉桂皮、玉米須和麵粉等原料的麻袋和捆。堆高你的倉庫！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">玉米稈玩偶 - 一個用玉米製成的可怕小玩偶。如果你真想的話，可以把它掛在天花板上。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">玉米芯煙斗 - 冒泡泡！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">懸掛食物 - 一直想把糧倉掛在天花板上嗎？Extra Delight 實現了這點！目前可見於洋蔥、薄荷、火腿、玉米、大蒜和兩類辣椒。</span>\n\n![](https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1138/919/untitled-png.png)\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">方格布方塊和地毯 - 可愛的小方格讓你感到溫馨的廚房地氣氛。提供全部 16 種顏色（是的，甚至包括白色）。</span> \n\n__<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/faq.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>__\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">我怎麼做醋（或酵母）？</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">你有嘗試在 JEI 中搜尋“醋”這個詞嗎？或者看看成就系統…？</span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">為什麼咖啡蛋糕裡沒有咖啡？</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">原因類似於茶蛋糕裡沒有茶的原因。這是為了<strong>搭配</strong>咖啡食用。</span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">為什麼我不能做這些帶肉的/血腥的食譜？</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">這需要你安裝 ED 的一個姊妹模組：<a href=\"[https://modrinth.com/mod/butchercraft](https://modrinth.com/mod/butchercraft)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Butchercraft!</a> 或使用相同標籤的任何其他肉食模組。</span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">為什麼我無法製作 <em>(在此插入食譜名稱)</em> ？</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">你檢查過所有食材嗎？如果你在模組包中使用 Extra Delight，很可能使用的是其他模組提供的黃油或麵粉。雖然 Extra Delight 會盡可能在其食譜中使用標籤……但並非所有模組都將其食材添加到相應標籤中。如果使用 JEI，它應該會顯示出可以使用哪些版本的食材。否則嘗試只用 100% 的 Extra Delight 食材製作食譜，如果你仍有困難，加入 Discord，我們會盡力解決！</span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">為什麼我無法在手持盾牌時從晾乾架或研缽移除物品？</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">這是原版遊戲的問題（shift + 右鍵）。你會發現，如果有盾牌在身，蹲下時也無法開門。</span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">為什麼我無法製作液態血巧克力？（沒有安裝 Butchercraft）</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">遺憾的是，當液體食材不可見時，它們並不像其他液體那麼明顯。鼠標懸停在食譜上時，你可以看到可可脂上方有一個液體，那就是若安裝了 Butchercraft 將會是血的位置。</span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">為什麼我找不到其他巧克力液體的食譜呢？</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">尷尬的是巧克力液體是裝在瓶子裡但當液體使用的，目前還沒有連接它們的東西。這將在未來更新中修復，但目前請嘗試搜尋例如“液態牛奶巧克力”然後選擇瓶子項目。</span></p>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">我怎麼進入玉米維度？</span>\n\n<p style=\"padding-left: 40px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">從未聽說過。</span></p> \n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/compat.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">J.E.I.</a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Create</a><br></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/salt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">The Salt</a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/tough-as-nails\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Tough As Nails</a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/vampirism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">Vampirism</a></span> \n\n<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/bugs.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">如果你用附魔或損壞的煎鍋製作玉米麵包或 Tart Tatin，只會得到普通/完好的回產物。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">肉桂/水果系列缺少告示牌、懸掛告示牌以及船和箱子船。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">流體接觸時會互相毀滅。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">Blood 在未安裝 Butchercraft 的情況下在液態血巧克力食譜中並不明顯。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">目前尚無代碼連接流體和瓶子物品。</span> \n\n<span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/languages.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">zh_cn - 感謝 Cloud_Meow！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">fr_fr - 感謝 Léon！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">ru_ru - 感謝 mpustovoi!<br></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">en_gb, en_nz</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">如果你想貢獻翻譯，請基於英文姓名而不是物品 ID 進行翻譯，因為許多物品自創建以來已更改。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/blob/1.21/src/generated/resources/assets/extradelight/lang/en_us.json\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://github.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/blob/1.21/src/generated/resources/assets/extradelight/lang/en_us.json</a></span> \n\n[![](https://lh7-rt.googleusercontent.com/docsz/AD_4nXf5dv9ZTSeRu53qp4eMqAig2MxHIe6aA5ZmRRNX7DdLduC2ylQVWRl_57_AlNwiOxbFJq8j2ggmEjjy1dtLFOx0oxh6_INyQKTnPibGGvFrbaOehLM3wJUO5TnOlCuRiV2nz_g5?key=qrDTHmrylnAmnfWStjqRVQ)](https://rocketnode.com/lance5057)\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: bold; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">我已與 RocketNode Hosting 合作！</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">RocketNode 提供全球頂級的伺服器託管服務，讓您只需幾秒鐘即可建立自己的伺服器！直觀的控制台使伺服器管理變得輕鬆自如，您甚至可以設定自動重啟而無需編寫任何程式碼。</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">使用優惠碼 LANCE5057 即可在第一個月享受其任何遊戲服務 25% 的折扣。開始在這裡：</span> [https://rocketnode.com/lance5057](https://rocketnode.com/lance5057) \n\n[<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/discord.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span></span>](https://discord.gg/SuUuXchG8x)\n\n[<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/patreon.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span></span>](https://www.patreon.com/c/SirLance)\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\"><span style=\"border: none; display: inline-block; width: 253px;\"><img style=\"margin-left: 0px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Lance5057/ExtraDelight/refs/heads/1.21/descriptionimages/credits.png\" width=\"253\" height=\"69\"></span></span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">Alan199921</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">DivineAspect</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">Skysom</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">FreneticScribbler</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">Lanse505</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">Belathus</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">RoyalJelly</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">ParadigmOne</span>\n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; text-decoration: none;\">Robynstar</span> \n\n<span style=\"font-size: 11pt; font-family: Ari